# Keep secrets, git history and bulk out of the build context. The server's env file is made on the
# server and read by Compose at run time; it must never end up in an image.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
# Client data from development, wherever it sits (apps/web/.data is where PDFs are saved).
**/.data
**/invoice-archive
deploy/backups
promo
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
*.log
